<body data-page="04B"><nav data-site-nav aria-label="dSpark 学习页面"></nav><main class="page page--wide">
  <header class="hero"><span class="topic-badge">专题页 · 归属 04 置信度 / 预算 / 布局</span><p class="eyebrow">04B · 当前存活率 / 全局 Top-k / 布局</p><h1>budget=2 只是两个名额；本轮存活率排名把它们分给 req1 与 req0</h1><p class="lead"><code>ScheduleVerifyLensTopk.execute()</code> 对当前 confidence 再做一次 <code>cumprod</code>，把全 batch extra slots 排名。因为每行 survival 随位置不增，按请求统计入选数就能还原连续 prefix length。</p><div class="evidence-strip"><span><strong>当前样本</strong> · <code>C_t</code> 不是历史预算样本</span><span><strong>原始预算</strong> · 2 extra，不包含 anchor</span><span><strong>默认结果</strong> · <code>verify_lens=[2,2]</code></span><span><strong>对齐开启</strong> · allowance=3，结果 <code>[2,3]</code></span></div><div class="route-switch"><button type="button" data-route-choice="static-greedy">STATIC · 贪心</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="compact-sampling">COMPACT · 随机采样</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="folded-greedy">FOLDED · 贪心</button></div><div data-semantic-legend></div></header>
  <section class="handoff"><div class="handoff__item"><b>输入</b><span>当前 <code>confidence[B,G]</code>、raw <code>budget=2</code>、<code>DSparkScheduleConfig(min_verify_len=1)</code>。</span></div><div class="handoff__item"><b>可选改写</b><span><code>_budget_aligned_to_graph_tier()</code> 只在显式 flag 开启时把 top-k allowance 放大。</span></div><div class="handoff__item"><b>输出</b><span><code>verify_lens[int32,B]</code>，随后封装为 <code>RaggedVerifyLayout</code>。</span></div><div class="handoff__item"><b>下一消费者</b><span>05 使用 layout gather/Target/scatter；CAP_ACCEPT 只在 06 用长度做 cutoff。</span></div></section>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="rank-title"><div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">主视图 · 当前矩阵与全局排名</p><h2 id="rank-title">从 <code>C_t</code> 到 <code>verify_lens=[2,2]</code> 的每一步</h2><p class="section__intro">蓝色矩阵是当前 proposal；绿色 #1/#2 是 raw budget 选中的两个 extra。黄色 #3 只在 graph-tier alignment 开启时成为真实验证槽。</p></div>
    <div class="visual stepper" data-stepper data-steps="5"><div class="visual__bar"><span><strong>B=2 · G=4</strong> · top-k 在全 batch 上做，不是每请求各选 k 个</span><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#rank-canvas">放大主图</button></div><div class="visual__body"><div class="stepper__toolbar"><div class="stepper__buttons"><button type="button" data-step-action="prev">上一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="next">下一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="play">播放</button><button type="button" data-step-action="reset">重置</button></div><div class="stepper__progress"><span data-step-progress></span></div><div class="stepper__status" data-step-status></div></div><div class="canvas-scroll"><div id="rank-canvas" class="rank-canvas">
      <div class="matrix" data-step-node="0"><div class="head">当前 confidence</div><div class="head">pos0 · 第 1 个 draft</div><div class="head">pos1 · 第 2 个 draft</div><div class="head">pos2 · 第 3 个 draft</div><div class="head">pos3 · 第 4 个 draft</div><div class="row-label">req0 · C_t</div><div class="cell"><b>.95</b></div><div class="cell"><b>.90</b></div><div class="cell"><b>.70</b></div><div class="cell"><b>.20</b></div><div class="row-label">req1 · C_t</div><div class="cell"><b>.99</b></div><div class="cell"><b>.95</b></div><div class="cell"><b>.92</b></div><div class="cell"><b>.85</b></div></div>
      <div class="matrix" data-step-node="1" style="margin-top:16px"><div class="head">survival = cumprod</div><div class="head">pos0</div><div class="head">pos1</div><div class="head">pos2</div><div class="head">pos3</div><div class="row-label">req0 · S_t</div><div class="cell" data-rank="2"><b>.9500</b><span>.95</span></div><div class="cell"><b>.8550</b><span>.95×.90</span></div><div class="cell"><b>.5985</b></div><div class="cell"><b>.1197</b></div><div class="row-label">req1 · S_t</div><div class="cell" data-rank="1"><b>.9900</b><span>.99</span></div><div class="cell" data-rank="3" data-selected="false"><b>.9405</b><span>.99×.95</span></div><div class="cell"><b>.8653</b></div><div class="cell"><b>.7355</b></div></div>
      <div class="rank-list" data-step-node="2"><span class="rank-chip" data-take="true">#1 req1.pos0<br>.9900</span><span class="rank-chip" data-take="true">#2 req0.pos0<br>.9500</span><span class="rank-chip" data-align-only="true">#3 req1.pos1<br>.9405</span><span class="rank-chip">#4 req1.pos2<br>.8653</span><span class="rank-chip">#5 req0.pos1<br>.8550</span><span class="rank-chip">#6 req1.pos3<br>.7355</span><span class="rank-chip">#7 req0.pos2<br>.5985</span><span class="rank-chip">#8 req0.pos3<br>.1197</span></div>
      <div class="length-build" data-step-node="3"><article class="length-card"><b>raw budget</b><code>take=2</code></article><article class="length-card"><b>selected requests</b><code>req1 +1<br>req0 +1</code></article><article class="length-card"><b>selected_extra</b><code>[1,1]</code></article><article class="length-card" data-kind="guard"><b>anchor floor</b><code>min_verify_len=1<br>effective floor≥1</code></article><article class="length-card" data-kind="main"><b>verify_lens</b><code>[1,1]+[1,1]<br>= [2,2]</code></article></div>
      <div class="dependency-note" data-step-node="4" style="margin-top:18px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--main);color:var(--muted)"><strong>为什么仍是连续前缀：</strong>同一请求的 survival 是 confidence 前缀积；confidence 在 [0,1] 时后置值不大于前置值。某个后置位置能入选时，它的前置位置不会排名更低，因此按请求计数可还原 prefix length。</div>
    </div></div></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="align-title"><div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">辅助视图 · 单一配置开关实验</p><h2 id="align-title">把本来要 padding 的第 5 个物理槽，换成 req1 的一次真实验证</h2><p class="section__intro">raw SPS decision 始终是 2。显式开关只把送入 top-k 的 allocator allowance 对齐到 graph tier：本例从 2 放大到 3；它不修改历史 decision，也不改变 layout 自己的 tier 计算。</p></div>
    <div class="visual"><div class="visual__bar"><span><strong>graph tier=5</strong> · 非 DP、TP=1 的固定教学条件</span><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#align-lab">放大辅助图</button></div><div class="visual__body"><div id="align-lab" class="align-lab" data-align="off">
      <div class="align-control"><label><input type="checkbox" data-align-toggle> 开启 <code>--speculative-dspark-align-verify-tokens-to-graph-tier</code></label><p class="only-off">默认关闭：<code>_budget_aligned_to_graph_tier()</code> 原样返回 raw budget=2。</p><p class="only-on">显式开启：graph tier 可容纳 5 行，扣除 2 个 anchor floor 后 allowance=3；top-k 额外纳入 #3 req1.pos1。</p></div>
      <div class="align-output"><div><b>raw decision</b><output>2</output><span>两种状态都不变</span></div><div><b>top-k allowance</b><output class="only-off">2</output><output class="only-on">3</output><span>只在开关开启时放大</span></div><div><b>verify_lens</b><output class="only-off">[2,2]</output><output class="only-on">[2,3]</output><span>包含 anchor</span></div><div><b>logical rows</b><output class="only-off">4</output><output class="only-on">5</output><span>真实 Target 行</span></div><div><b>padding rows</b><output class="only-off">1</output><output class="only-on">0</output><span>graph physical tier=5</span></div></div>
    </div></div></div>
    <div class="callouts" style="margin-top:18px"><div class="callout" data-kind="guard"><b>边界 · 不是总能填满</b><p>仍受每请求最大 verify length、survival_eps、captured grid 与 DP tier 协议限制；本页的 5 是固定示例，不是通用常数。</p></div><div class="callout" data-kind="fail"><b>易错 · budget 不含 anchor</b><p><code>budget=2</code> 不是“总共 forward 两行”；B=2 的 mandatory floor 已经贡献两行，所以默认 logical rows=4。</p></div></div>
  </section>
